            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Light sleeper? Choose ultrasonic and distilled water.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Ultrasonic machines carry the lowest published noise ratings. Their weakness is white dust from hard water, and distilled water solves it. If you cannot use distilled water, an evaporative unit on its lowest fan speed is the better compromise.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

